        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, because we operate communities that participate in federal and/or state healthcare reimbursement programs, we are subject to federal and state laws that prohibit anyone from presenting, or causing to be presented, claims for reimbursement which are false, fraudulent, or are for items or services that were not provided as claimed.",
        "start_character": 58491,
        "end_character": 58836
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001332349-26-000032",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001332349-26-000032-9ada1d99c21045ef",
        "accession_number": "0001332349-26-000032",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, we provide memory care services at 312 of our communities, aggregating 8,353 memory care units across our segments.",
        "start_character": 26955,
        "end_character": 27095
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001332349-26-000032",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001332349-26-000032-9ada1d99c21045ef",
        "accession_number": "0001332349-26-000032",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As we continue to focus on driving organic growth in our business, in the near and longer term, we also intend to (i) exit certain non-strategic or underperforming owned assets when possible, (ii) exit or restructure underperforming leases as we approach lease maturity, where possible, (iii) expand our footprint and services in certain core markets, and (iv) explore further growth opportunities, such as opportunistic acquisitions (including potential acquisitions of currently leased assets) and other expansions of our senior living business, subject to capital availability.",
        "start_character": 8365,
        "end_character": 8945
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001332349-26-000032",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001332349-26-000032-9ada1d99c21045ef",
        "accession_number": "0001332349-26-000032",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For an additional cost at these communities, we offer higher levels of personal care services to residents who are more physically frail or require more frequent or intensive physical assistance or increased personal care and supervision due to cognitive impairments.",
        "start_character": 27867,
        "end_character": 28134
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001332349-26-000032",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001332349-26-000032-9ada1d99c21045ef",
        "accession_number": "0001332349-26-000032",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to internal development opportunities, we have also developed a program to build business acumen skills to drive improved community performance, and associates continue to have opportunities for professional development through our advanced fee and tuition assistance programs.",
        "start_character": 46507,
        "end_character": 46796
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001332349-26-000032",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001332349-26-000032-9ada1d99c21045ef",
        "accession_number": "0001332349-26-000032",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In several of the states in which we operate assisted living and memory care communities, skilled nursing facilities or home care agencies require a certificate of need before a community or agency may be opened or the services at an existing community may be expanded.",
        "start_character": 52273,
        "end_character": 52542
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001332349-26-000032",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001332349-26-000032-9ada1d99c21045ef",
        "accession_number": "0001332349-26-000032",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our comprehensive network of services, we help to provide seniors with care, connection, and services to support their lifestyle in an environment that feels like home.",
        "start_character": 30858,
        "end_character": 31034
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001332349-26-000032",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001332349-26-000032-9ada1d99c21045ef",
        "accession_number": "0001332349-26-000032",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also plan to continue to explore additional products and services that we may offer to our residents or to seniors living outside of our communities and, where opportunities arise, we would expect to pursue development, investment, and acquisition opportunities to further enhance and grow our senior living portfolio.",
        "start_character": 6188,
        "end_character": 6509
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001332349-26-000032",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001332349-26-000032-9ada1d99c21045ef",
        "accession_number": "0001332349-26-000032",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide memory care services at freestanding memory care communities that are specifically designed for residents with dementia, including Alzheimer's disease and other forms of cognitive impairment.",
        "start_character": 26589,
        "end_character": 26796
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001332349-26-000032",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001332349-26-000032-9ada1d99c21045ef",
        "accession_number": "0001332349-26-000032",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are the largest of a limited number of operators that provide a broad range of community locations and service level offerings at varying price levels.",
